  "content": {
    "id": "p23-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "The journey from Melbourne to Adelaide is $660$ km. A train leaves Adelaide at the same time as a second train leaves Melbourne, travelling in the opposite direction. The train travelling from Melbourne to Adelaide travels twice as fast as the train travelling in the reverse direction and arrives $3$ hours earlier. How fast is the train from Adelaide to Melbourne?",
